id = &"sawdust_rations"
title = "Sawdust Rations"
description = "THE BEAT: the food crisis of the middle campaign. It works — nearly half again the rations — and every single person can taste what is in it. The tree offers this exactly when the arithmetic of starvation has become unavoidable, because that is the only time a player takes it."
flavour = "Sawdust, bark meal, and enough salt to hide it. It fills. It does not feed."
